name: Bounded agentic preparation and honest partial source receipts
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/agentic_preparation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | initialized
submit: campaign preparation-study
require-live-snap: 30 2 job(s) | fixed-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-study
expect: 2
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 30 Agentic preparation: snippet limit 1 | preparation-options
expect: byte limit 64
ask: Can the operator inspect the frozen preparation options and allowance before starting the two fixed jobs?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/agentic_preparation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 2 completed | completed
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | result
nav-mode:
keys: u
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study preparation-study | report
keys: p
require-live-snap: 30 Plan digest: | report-details
resize: 160x48
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-tail-40x12
ask: Are completion and unknown coverage distinguished, with the finite workload and protected spending retained?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/agentic_preparation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
